MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Richard L Kaysen and City Council
FROM:
Rudy T. Apodaca, Director of Purchasing
DATE:
March 6, 2013
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid No. M-12-13 for an annual purchase for HOT MIX, TACK
OIL, AND COLD MIX
______________________________________________________________________________
Two  bids were received for the bituminous  hot mix, emulsified asphalt tack oil, and bituminous
cold mix patch materials.  The City estimates that it will use 8,000 tons of hot mix, 6000 gallons of
tack oil, and 400 tons of cold mix (with an option for additional 300 ton) .  Bids were as follows:
Bidder
Total Bid
Knife River
Hot Mix
$51.95/Ton
$415,600.00
Cheyenne, WY.
Tack Oil
$ 1.15/Gal.
$    6,900.00
Cold Mix
$77.50/Ton
$ 31,000.00
$453,500.00
Simon Contractors
Hot Mix
$53.95/Ton
$423,600.00
Cheyenne, WY.
Tack Oil
$   1.10/Gal.
$    6,600.00
Cold Mix
$75.00/Ton
$ 30,000.00
Total:
$460,200.00
It is recommended the bid be awarded to the low bidder, Knife River.,  for its bid prices shown
above.  The annual expenditure will depend upon actual quantities used through April 15, 2014
Funding is in the 2011/14 1% sales tax account #021-26-2616-42-32302.
```
